OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Patchy low cloud and mist may
OL,9,Fform over higher ground later. Staying
OL,10,Frather warm in some urban areas but
OL,11,Fconsiderably cooler in the countryside
OL,12,Fby dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FAnother primarily sunny day
OL,15,Fwith just a little wispy high cloud at
OL,16,Ftimes. Slightly breezier than on
OL,17,FMonday but temperatures climbing
OL,18,Fhigher and becoming very warm by the
OL,19,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
